		"change": "retainer-billing-engine",
		"adr": "ADR-037 modular manifest fragment — never edit src/manifest.json",
		"description": "T2 retainer-billing UI: four sidebar entries (Retainer Pools, Drawdowns, Rollovers, True-Ups), each with type:index and corresponding type:detail pages. Pool detail nests sections for Drawdowns, Rollovers, and True-Ups so operators can drill from the pool into its consumption + reconciliation trail. True-Up detail exposes lifecycle action buttons (submit → approve → invoice → settle, and reverse) wired to the RetainerTrueUp.x-openregister-lifecycle transitions; approve/reverse honour the retainer:approve-true-up permission per ADR-023. A dialog page (RetainerPoolCreateDialog) provides the create-pool flow with non-overlapping-period validation surfaced at submit time. Manual true-up trigger is exposed as a pool-detail action with confirmation modal; under-utilisation amount surfaces alongside overage in the true-up detail view for credit-note workflows."
	},
